        <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50/70 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-900 block mb-1">?? Th? m?nh l�m s�ng n?i b?t:</span>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Th�nh th?o k? thu?t cham s�c b?nh nh�n n?ng ICU, ki?m so�t nhi?m khu?n v� tu�n th? quy tr�nh an to�n ngu?i b?nh d?t di?m tuy?t d?i.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 block mb-1">?? G?i � ph�n c�ng nhi?m v? ph� h?p:</span>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-4 text-slate-600 space-y-1">
            <li>�?m nhi?m ca tr?c h?i s?c c?p c?u v� b?nh nh�n th? m�y.</li>
            <li>Tham gia k�m c?p hu?ng d?n l�m s�ng (Preceptor) cho di?u du?ng t?p s?.</li>
